claim.claim-text:
receiving (220), by a terminal device, first signaling sent by a network device, the first signaling comprising beam information of M beams, M being a positive integer;
performing (230), by the terminal device, carrier sensing on all or part of beams of the M beams according to the first signaling; and
selecting (240), by the terminal device, one of the all or part of beams according to a sensing result to send a UL channel to the network device.

perform, according to priorities of the M beams, carrier sensing on the M beams one by one in a sequence from high to low priorities, and/or
wherein N beams which comprise the Nth beam and on which carrier sensing is performed correspond to N sensing windows one to one, and a sensing window used by the terminal device to perform carrier sensing on each beam of the N beams is the sensing window corresponding to the beam;
wherein the N sensing windows are N successive sensing windows.
